## muxa (tmux agent mail)

Use skill **muxa-parent** only if `muxa parent` is empty; **muxa-worker** only if this pane was spawned (`muxa parent` prints a name). Halt if the other skill is used in the wrong pane.
CLIs in this tmux server can message a parent or child with `muxa send <name> <text>`.
Incoming mail arrives as a user turn tagged `[muxa]`. Do not poll. Do not ack.
Reply only with a question, a result, or a blocker.
`muxa who` lists panes. Do not message siblings or other roots.
